          "filename": "Beautiful Day on Mount Si - Flickr - brewbooks.jpg",
          "caption": "It was great to see Rainier and the surrounding mountains out on a sunny afternoon on Mount Si.\nAbout every other week I have been heading up Mount Si with a pack, each week adding a little more weight to get in shape for a Mount Rainier climb in June. This week was 52 pounds, and it was a nice day for a hike.\n\ns 016",
